  unitName: Fire Bird Migina (EU)
  unitId: 710234
  unitNumber: 7228
  description: "A pure Shapeshifter with a tragic destiny. This young girl is the
    little sister of a woman who will one day become an acclaimed politician. Migina
    lived a peaceful childhood in her village. She was happy there with her parents
    and her older sister, Magena, who she admired. When her older sister went away
    for a few days, a group of nefarious Shapeshifters arrived. The villagers were
    unable to defend themselves against the cruelty of these rogues. Shortly afterwards,
    Magena returned to a horrific scene: houses were on fire and villagers\u2019
    bodies had been brutally massacred. She rushed towards her small house and saw
    an image she would never forget: her parents and beloved little sister, also
    lifeless. Magena collapsed to the ground. She had lost everything in the blink
    of an eye. She then stumbled upon a man, lying in agony, who was able to give
    her a name: Cornelius..."
  summonDesc: "One day, I\u2019ll be as strong as my big sis!"
  fusionDesc: "Magena, she\u2019s the best!"
